cff-version: 1.2.0
title: MoDES
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - name: MoDES contributors
repository-code: 'https://github.com/Lings01/MoDES'
abstract: >-
  MoDES (Multi-Omics Discordance/Event State inference) is a statistical
  framework that treats regulatory events as the primary unit of analysis.
  It classifies cross-modality concordance and discordance into interpretable
  regulatory states with artifact risk assessment.
keywords:
  - multi-omics
  - regulatory genomics
  - single-cell
  - chromatin
  - transcriptomics
  - epigenomics
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0-alpha
date-released: '2026-05-14'
